      "body": "<!-- ciflow-pending -->\n~~Workflows were awaiting approval.~~ CI has now been triggered for the ciflow labels on this PR.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T04:16:13Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/pytorch/torchtitan/pull/5262#issuecomment-6093670806",
      "id": 6093670806,
